{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In Soccer Puzzle, every line you draw is a clever shot at victory. Feel the thrill of solving tricky paths, bending physics to your will, and watching the ball roll perfectly into the goal. It\u2019s all about smart moves, sweet goals, and satisfying wins.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939370/extras/7849c12a42f6b3d3ea5d35d2a58174c0.webp?t=1758203303\" width=200 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939370/extras/f02d51bc73ba26bdd2d382288b01bb60.poster.avif?t=1758203303\" width=600 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939370/extras/f02d51bc73ba26bdd2d382288b01bb60.webm?t=1758203303\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939370/extras/f02d51bc73ba26bdd2d382288b01bb60.mp4?t=1758203303\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Soccer Puzzle</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soccer Puzzle features 10 carefully designed levels where you draw the path to guide the ball into the goal using realistic physics. Each level offers a unique challenge that tests your logic, precision, and creativity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939370/extras/250e1b56d1fda23a11b024697138b470.webp?t=1758203303\" width=275 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939370/extras/ea93c8fd17c9d194cd5e6f60096e3503.poster.avif?t=1758203303\" width=600 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939370/extras/ea93c8fd17c9d194cd5e6f60096e3503.webm?t=1758203303\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939370/extras/ea93c8fd17c9d194cd5e6f60096e3503.mp4?t=1758203303\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your experience with 2 pencil types, 10 pencil colors, and 9 soccer ball skins. Whether you're casually experimenting or aiming for the perfect shot, each attempt brings a satisfying mix of strategy and fun.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3939370?t=1758203303","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3939370?t=1758203303","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939370/9b844605b0d94097d1a81b5e111cd4a074b74446/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758203303","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939370/9b844605b0d94097d1a81b5e111cd4a074b74446/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758203303","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Soccer Puzzle</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939370/extras/86e04fd3e757783f10e0cbe8e9a20cd5.avif?t=1758203303\" width=600 height=190 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In Soccer Puzzle, every line you draw is a clever shot at victory. Feel the thrill of solving tricky paths, bending physics to your will, and watching the ball roll perfectly into the goal. It\u2019s all about smart moves, sweet goals, and satisfying wins.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939370/extras/7849c12a42f6b3d3ea5d35d2a58174c0.webp?t=1758203303\" width=200 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939370/extras/f02d51bc73ba26bdd2d382288b01bb60.poster.avif?t=1758203303\" width=600 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939370/extras/f02d51bc73ba26bdd2d382288b01bb60.webm?t=1758203303\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939370/extras/f02d51bc73ba26bdd2d382288b01bb60.mp4?t=1758203303\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Soccer Puzzle</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soccer Puzzle features 10 carefully designed levels where you draw the path to guide the ball into the goal using realistic physics. Each level offers a unique challenge that tests your logic, precision, and creativity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939370/extras/250e1b56d1fda23a11b024697138b470.webp?t=1758203303\" width=275 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939370/extras/ea93c8fd17c9d194cd5e6f60096e3503.poster.avif?t=1758203303\" width=600 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939370/extras/ea93c8fd17c9d194cd5e6